# Change management

## Before

1. Inspect implementation + `doc/`  
2. Dependencies (web contracts, board profiles, pin maps)  
3. Security/data/hardware risks  
4. Intended behavior  
5. Smallest safe change  

## After

- Inspect diff; remove accidental edits  
- Build relevant env; update docs when behavior/wiring changed  
- Report remaining risks  

Prefer reversible changes. No unrelated refactors. No flash/erase/GPIO changes without explicit hardware authorization.
